# Grok 5 — findings by Mimo v2.6 Flash (EXCLUDED — unreleased, no verified benchmarks)

- Source: SpaceXAI (xAI)/Grok 5
- Date: 2026-10-02 (UTC)
- Overview and scoring methodology: `../../model-comparison.md`
- Cross-model signed log: `../../model-findings.md`

> **Self-exclusion:** Grok 5 has not been released as of 2026-10-02 — there is no API, no model card, no spec sheet and **zero verified public benchmark numbers** for this exact model. Every score row would be a guess, so this file is saved as `.excluded` and `pnpm sync` skips it. No scores below are used in averages.

## Model card

- **Name:** Grok 5 (unreleased; xAI/SpaceXAI next flagship)
- **Short description:** SpaceXAI's in-training successor to the Grok 4.x line, officially confirmed "in training" only in xAI's 2026-01-06 Series E announcement; positioned by Musk (2026-09-14 X replies) as two release rungs behind the current flagship — Grok 4.8 and 4.9 ship first. Not a usable model today.
- **Provider / access:** **none** — no API endpoint, model ID, alpha/beta, or third-party host exists (kie.ai, geotoolbox, felloai all confirm as of late Sept 2026). Expected eventual rollout: X Premium+ / SuperGrok Heavy first, then app, then xAI API (historical xAI pattern, unconfirmed).
- **Release / knowledge:** **no release date.** Missed windows: late 2025 (Musk, Nov 2025), Q1 2026, Q2 2026; Q3 2026 also closed with nothing on xAI's News page (felloai, 2026-09-23). Polymarket priced "released by 2026-12-31" at roughly a coin flip (mid-40s–mid-50s%, 2026-09-16).
- **IDs:** none assigned. (Shipping xAI models: `grok-4.5` / `grok-4.6` / `grok-4.7` — 500K ctx, $2/$6 — are different checkpoints.)
- **Context window:** no official figure. Rumored ~1.5M tokens (unconfirmed estimate; shipping Grok 4.7 = 500K, Grok 4.3 = 1M).
- **Modalities:** rumored natively multimodal text/image/audio/real-time video (Tesorb leak-level reporting) — unconfirmed; nothing official.
- **Pricing:** not announced. Existing SuperGrok tiers ($10/$30/$100/$300 per month; X Premium+ $40) and API pattern ($2/$6 for 4.x flagships) are anchors only, not Grok 5 prices.
- **Architecture:** rumored 6T (Musk, Baron Capital Nov 2025) and 10T MoE variants training on Colossus 2 (Memphis, ~520K GB200 + 30K GB300); reports of dynamic agent spawning and cross-session memory are leaks. xAI has published no spec sheet.

