### Explicitly NOT attributable to this model

Grok 4.5 / 4.6 / 4.7 numbers (TB2.1 83.3%, SWE-Pro 64.7%, AA Index 54, GPQA 93% for 4.5; 4.6/4.7 at AA Index 61-class, SWE-V 95.6% Vals for 4.7's line) belong to **different shipped checkpoints** and must not be copied into a Grok 5 row. Leaks ("Project Valis" etc.) are flagged unreliable by trackers.

